      "name": "Element Coin",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "coin",
      "description": "Signature: an element coin with a gilt keyline; it springs up and glows in its element when hovered or selected.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-coins\"><button class=\"ds-coin\" style=\"--c:#68d445\" aria-label=\"Life\"><i></i></button><button class=\"ds-coin on\" style=\"--c:#3fa9f5\" aria-label=\"Water\"><i></i></button><button class=\"ds-coin\" style=\"--c:#ff6a3d\" aria-label=\"Fire\"><i></i></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-coins{display:flex;gap:16px;padding:12px}.ds-coin{--s:1;width:58px;height:58px;border:0;padding:0;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 35%,#2a3a8c),#0c1238 75%);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px #f6c64f99,0 3px 0 #05081c,0 6px 12px #0007;transform:scale(var(--s));transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.3,1.5,.5,1),box-shadow .2s}.ds-coin i{width:40%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#fff,var(--c) 45%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 55%,#000))}.ds-coin:hover{--s:1.18;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #fff1b8,0 0 18px var(--c),0 3px 0 #05081c}.ds-coin.on{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2.5px #fff1b8,0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 70%,transparent),0 0 22px var(--c)}.ds-coin:active{--s:.94}.ds-coin:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f6c64f;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Gilt-Rimmed Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "The box and back panel: lapis card inside a 3px gilt foil rim with a darkened printed edge.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Set up in three steps.</h2><p>Extract the ZIP next to Cemu, add your NFC dumps, press play.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{max-width:560px;padding:34px 36px;border-radius:28px;border:3px solid transparent;color:#eef1ff;font:500 17px/1.6 Nunito,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#1b2678,#16206a 30%,#0b1446) padding-box,linear-gradient(165deg,#fff1b8,#f6c64f 30%,#9a6415 55%,#e7b347 80%,#fff1b8) border-box;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 6px #0a0f3355,0 30px 70px #000a}.ds-panel h2{margin:0 0 12px;font:400 2.2rem/1.04 'Lilita One',Nunito,sans-serif;color:#fff6da;text-shadow:0 3px 0 #05081c}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:#d3d9f6}"
    },
    {
